issue.body:
There seems to be a weird race condition or something where a reaction notification is created twice. Both notifications have `json_data: nil` and the same `created_at` timestamp.

![double notifications](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17884966/54693704-6f89e480-4afd-11e9-867a-14f96398bb93.png)

@lightalloy's WIP PR #2122 might resolve it, but I'm not sure what the root cause is.
